! C2H7O3Cl | caa007b: LAST IRC POINT at wB97X-D/6-31G(d,p)/PCM(water)
!
! Part of a 3-point refinement (caa007a/b/c) of the existing lower-level
! (6-31G(d)-ish) IRC's first, last, and TS geometries, prior to final
! single-point energies at wB97X-D/PCseg-2/PCM(water).
!
! This is the LAST point (Reaction Coordinate 89 of 89 in caa005bIRC.cml,
! energy -765.8919790 at the original lower level). Same rationale as
! caa007a (=caa005bIRCCML1st-prerelax-631Gdp.inp, the equivalent run for
! the FIRST point): the geometry was extracted from an IRC computed at a
! different level of theory, so it is not expected to be a stationary
! point at our target functional -- re-optimizing at a modest, native
! 6-31G(d,p) basis first (same functional/solvent as the eventual target)
! is the standard, well-tested bridging step, before moving to the larger
! PCseg-2 basis.
!
! Settings identical to caa007a: wB97X-D, PCM(water), native GBASIS=N31
! NGAUSS=6 NDFUNC=1 NPFUNC=1 (6-31G(d,p)), IHREP=1 (fresh Hessian every
! step, affordable at this basis size), DXMAX=0.02, Cartesian coordinates,
! METHOD=SEMINUM (wB97X-D has no analytic Hessian regardless of basis).

 $CONTRL SCFTYP=RHF RUNTYP=OPTIMIZE DFTTYP=wB97X-D
         COORD=UNIQUE MAXIT=200 NOSYM=1
 $END
 $GUESS GUESS=HUCKEL $END
 $BASIS GBASIS=N31 NGAUSS=6 NDFUNC=1 NPFUNC=1 $END
 $SCF CONV=1.0D-6
     SOSCF=.T.
     DAMP=.F.
     SHIFT=.T.
     DIRSCF=.TRUE.
 $END
 $STATPT OPTTOL=0.0001 NSTEP=300 IHREP=1 HSSEND=.T. DXMAX=0.02 NPRT=1 $END
 $ZMAT DLC=.F. AUTO=.F. $END
 $FORCE METHOD=SEMINUM PROJCT=.T. $END
 $PCM SOLVNT=WATER $END
 $SYSTEM MWORDS=100 MEMDDI=200 $END

 $DATA
Chloroacetaldehyde hydrate and water -- last IRC point, pre-relax at 6-31G(d,p)
C1
Cl   17.0   3.161147   0.737334   0.428993
C     6.0   2.754812   0.090038  -1.294459
C     6.0   3.293443   1.037766  -2.351014
O     8.0   2.523905   2.253921  -2.317175
H     1.0   1.670279   0.014534  -1.331701
H     1.0   3.238174  -0.880522  -1.356882
O     8.0   3.184134   0.387162  -3.665546
O     8.0   3.853288   2.951010  -4.591976
H     1.0   3.811574   3.469259  -5.400314
H     1.0   3.750463   2.012598  -4.816828
H     1.0   2.262050   0.157490  -3.846185
H     1.0   4.359320   1.227805  -2.236573
H     1.0   2.888248   2.841348  -3.010822
 $END

